  "player_text": "I shoulder through the rain and the crowd to the notice board and read the fresh postings on the new taxes, the curfew, and the missing patrol, looking for names, places, and how recently the ink was put up.",
  "visible_motivation": "The board is the plainest sign of what is wrong at this gate, and I can read it without pinning myself to one stranger's talk.",
